Description: vpn.panel-gl.inet: VPN panel for GL.iNet routers on OpenWrt (uhttpd :8088).
 Toggle transparent proxy, test connection and speed, save vless:// and
 hysteria2:// links, Naive server/login fields (official NaiveProxy
 config.json) and a WireGuard .conf, and
 autoupdate each protocol from its own saved connection link (when it is
 an http(s) subscription URL). The clients are not in the package:
 the Install VLESS, Install Hysteria 2, Install Naive and Install WireGuard
 buttons on the page install the official build of each one (nothing is
 downloaded when the package is installed).
 Every protocol is its own service: VLESS = Xray, Hysteria = hysteria, Naive = naive (+ dnsproxy for DNS), WireGuard = kernel interface; only one runs at a time and none goes through another. WireGuard needs kmod-wireguard and wireguard-tools (optional). Every client is optional.
